what should I fear when you are near?

644
00:46:28.827 --> 00:46:29.786
Then…

645
00:46:30.787 --> 00:46:32.414
tell me if it gets bad.

646
00:46:33.207 --> 00:46:34.583
You don't just have to put up with it.

647
00:46:39.796 --> 00:46:42.132
The only thing I'm good at is -

648
00:46:43.300 --> 00:46:44.510
put up with

649
00:46:44.593 --> 00:46:45.427
Really?

650
00:46:47.054 --> 00:46:48.764
my girl

651
00:46:51.600 --> 00:46:53.268
- Shall we go?
- Yes.

652
00:46:56.021 --> 00:46:59.149
Thank you to everyone who came
despite the urgency of the meeting.

653
00:46:59.233 --> 00:47:01.735
Everything is fine. Of course we came.

654
00:47:02.236 --> 00:47:03.946
The fact that everyone is here

655
00:47:04.029 --> 00:47:05.489
brings back memories. It's nice.

656
00:47:07.616 --> 00:47:09.451
If only mom was here.

657
00:47:10.536 --> 00:47:12.287
She is definitely in heaven.

658
00:47:12.371 --> 00:47:13.455
She was baptized.

659
00:47:14.039 --> 00:47:16.959
Now that I have taken her position,

660
00:47:17.042 --> 00:47:18.835
