661
00:47:18.919 --> 00:47:21.171
The higher you climb,
then you feel lonelier.

662
00:47:22.172 --> 00:47:24.216
Imagine how lonely she was.

663
00:47:24.299 --> 00:47:26.134
She was lonely not because of her position,

664
00:47:26.218 --> 00:47:29.012
and because she even has children
kept at a distance.

665
00:47:29.096 --> 00:47:32.015
I wonder why she was there
it's so cold with us

666
00:47:33.392 --> 00:47:35.394
