667
00:47:36.228 --> 00:47:39.064
Blood is not the main thing, Su An.

668
00:47:39.147 --> 00:47:41.608
Like-minded people who love each other
can be family.

669
00:47:41.692 --> 00:47:43.527
Are you protecting her because you are also from the Chu family?

670
00:47:44.111 --> 00:47:46.196
You can say that, you are not her child.

671
00:47:46.280 --> 00:47:50.200
It was not easy to live
the child of Chairman Choo Jeong-suk.

672
00:47:50.284 --> 00:47:52.035
Maybe our mother died

673
00:47:52.119 --> 00:47:55.664
but we must all leave
grievances and misunderstandings in the past.

674
00:47:55.747 --> 00:47:57.374
Of course, I did not instigate the offense.

675
00:47:57.457 --> 00:47:59.835
Perpetrators are usually not offended.

676
00:48:00.502 --> 00:48:01.712
The culprits?

677
00:48:01.795 --> 00:48:04.756
You say as if I did something.

678
00:48:04.840 --> 00:48:06.717
This is the psychology of the victim.

679
00:48:06.800 --> 00:48:09.136
This is because I am the victim.

680
00:48:09.219 --> 00:48:10.178
And what?

681
00:48:10.846 --> 00:48:13.432
Are you saying you're just an innocent victim?

682
00:48:14.141 --> 00:48:17.436
Every time I tried to take the hill,
you always fought back.

683
00:48:17.519 --> 00:48:18.520
Godi

684
00:48:18.604 --> 00:48:19.980
We decided not to fight.

685
00:48:20.897 --> 00:48:22.983
And past mistakes are still mistakes.

686
00:48:23.609 --> 00:48:24.610
I'm sorry, Soo An.

687
00:48:24.693 --> 00:48:25.652
Suk Here!

688
00:48:26.361 --> 00:48:27.237
Su An.

689
00:48:30.616 --> 00:48:31.617
sorry

690
00:48:31.700 --> 00:48:32.659
Good.

691
00:48:32.743 --> 00:48:34.369
I admit past mistakes.

692
00:48:42.210 --> 00:48:43.378
Dear,

693
00:48:43.462 --> 00:48:45.047
can you get us some more wine

694
00:48:47.007 --> 00:48:47.883
Of course.

695
00:48:53.347 --> 00:48:55.182
How's work, Suk Min?

696
00:48:55.265 --> 00:48:56.975
As you all know,

697
00:48:57.059 --> 00:48:58.685
