- Yes, sir.

752
00:52:30.522 --> 00:52:32.107
{\an8}Hello, says Choo Seok Hoon.

753
00:52:36.695 --> 00:52:37.654
What?

754
00:52:38.196 --> 00:52:41.533
Your order will be fulfilled by the end of the month.

755
00:52:44.828 --> 00:52:47.038
