756
00:52:47.998 --> 00:52:49.040
That's all.

757
00:52:55.338 --> 00:52:57.090
So why do you need all our promotions?

758
00:52:57.757 --> 00:52:59.843
To dissolve the committee
and part-time?

759
00:52:59.926 --> 00:53:01.011
This is wrong!

760
00:53:01.595 --> 00:53:03.930
I'm just running a business.

761
00:53:04.431 --> 00:53:06.349
This is not business, but murder!

762
00:53:07.851 --> 00:53:08.935
Listen.

763
00:53:09.019 --> 00:53:12.272
Maybe now it looks wise
but in the long run it will only hurt.

764
00:53:12.355 --> 00:53:15.567
Don't try to give it away
own beliefs for facts.

765
00:53:17.944 --> 00:53:20.196
I will tell the press and convince the shareholders.

766
00:53:21.031 --> 00:53:22.949
I will do anything to stop you.

767
00:53:30.874 --> 00:53:34.961
Notify the directors of the requirement
fire CEO Choo Seok-hoon.

768
00:53:40.634 --> 00:53:41.676
let's find out

769
00:53:42.218 --> 00:53:43.595
