772
00:54:08.119 --> 00:54:11.790
Go do your duty
like To To Hee's husband, don't hang around here.

773
00:54:11.873 --> 00:54:13.458
I came to see Ka Yong,

774
00:54:13.541 --> 00:54:15.877
