775
00:54:15.961 --> 00:54:18.672
You seem to care
your human companion.

776
00:54:19.297 --> 00:54:22.467
Come on! This is a new outfit!

777
00:54:26.262 --> 00:54:28.932
By the way, you will not return
instructions for the demon?

778
00:54:29.015 --> 00:54:32.644
No. Who cares about books
full of threats?

779
00:54:32.727 --> 00:54:33.853
You should return it.

780
00:54:33.937 --> 00:54:36.481
Loss of instructions twice
reduces the price in case of resale.

781
00:54:36.564 --> 00:54:40.026
It's okay to treat me
as for household appliances!

782
00:54:40.694 --> 00:54:42.737
<i>And I still know so little about you.</i>

783
00:54:43.321 --> 00:54:45.949
I would very much agree
and instruction to the demon.

784
00:54:50.662 --> 00:54:51.830
Done with anger?

785
00:54:51.913 --> 00:54:53.665
I will return that instruction.

786
00:54:56.584 --> 00:54:58.545
I knew you would give up eventually.

787
00:55:04.718 --> 00:55:05.760
Hello Seok Hoon.

788
00:55:05.844 --> 00:55:06.803
To Hee

789
00:55:07.679 --> 00:55:09.597
Suk Min showed what he really is.

790
00:55:24.946 --> 00:55:26.614
"MIRE HOSPITAL"

791
00:55:26.698 --> 00:55:28.616
Make it impossible for her to communicate with the world

792
00:55:29.200 --> 00:55:31.995
and keep her in the hospital
until further instructions.

793
00:55:32.078 --> 00:55:32.954
Yes, sir.

794
00:55:34.831 --> 00:55:37.625
<i>I relayed your orders
regarding the wife, sir.</i>

795
00:55:42.047 --> 00:55:43.173
You can't come here, lady!

796
00:55:43.256 --> 00:55:45.550
So how do you manage?

797
00:55:45.633 --> 00:55:48.762
You push the solution thanks to the directors,
who is on your side

798
00:55:53.183 --> 00:55:55.226
Ms. Chu's priority

799
00:55:55.310 --> 00:55:58.063
was the balance of profits
and social responsibility.

800
00:55:58.146 --> 00:56:00.190
- How could you neglect...
- It looks like you

801
00:56:00.273 --> 00:56:02.108
