802
00:56:04.486 --> 00:56:06.196
I know why you do that.

803
00:56:07.781 --> 00:56:09.991
You want to overshadow Ms. Chu.

804
00:56:11.284 --> 00:56:14.370
Do you think you can beat her like that?

805
00:56:14.454 --> 00:56:15.455
No.

806
00:56:15.538 --> 00:56:18.583
This only proves that you are not worthy of her at all.

807
00:56:18.666 --> 00:56:21.544
How much longer do you plan to live in her shadow?

808
00:56:22.462 --> 00:56:23.838
Take it To Hee.

809
00:56:23.922 --> 00:56:25.965
My mother's world is gone.

810
00:56:28.301 --> 00:56:29.928
I hatched from the egg.

811
00:56:32.347 --> 00:56:33.973
<i>This is Ki Kwang Chul's phone.</i>

812
00:56:36.726 --> 00:56:40.063
{\an8}ABRAXASU

813
00:56:50.615 --> 00:56:52.075
Abraxas.

814
00:56:55.662 --> 00:56:58.289
"The bird breaks out of the egg.

815
00:56:59.833 --> 00:57:01.292
To be born

816
00:57:02.460 --> 00:57:05.004
