817
00:57:09.259 --> 00:57:10.927
The world you destroyed...

818
00:57:15.014 --> 00:57:16.432
is Choo Jung Suk.

819
00:57:26.401 --> 00:57:28.069
This is your problem.

820
00:57:29.070 --> 00:57:31.698
If you didn't get into it,
everyone would be safe.

821
00:57:31.781 --> 00:57:34.826
But you're always causing trouble
because you can never back down.

822
00:57:37.495 --> 00:57:38.913
if not for you

823
00:57:38.997 --> 00:57:40.999
this would not be the end of it.

824
00:57:44.878 --> 00:57:46.379
Why would you go so far?

825
00:57:48.756 --> 00:57:50.842
To get revenge for the lovely Ms. Choo Jung-suk?

826
00:57:53.094 --> 00:57:56.222
I think she is like a god for you.

827
00:57:57.974 --> 00:57:59.893
How could you…

828
00:58:00.852 --> 00:58:03.438
How could you kill your own mother?

829
00:58:04.022 --> 00:58:05.440
That old woman was a devil.

830
00:58:05.523 --> 00:58:07.609
I eventually became one

831
00:58:07.692 --> 00:58:09.152
through your dear Almighty Chu.

832
00:58:10.820 --> 00:58:14.491
I was a sinner before I began to sin.

833
00:58:14.574 --> 00:58:17.118
She threw her sins on me
on your own child

834
00:58:17.202 --> 00:58:19.078
and even blamed my blood!

835
00:58:19.162 --> 00:58:20.163
Why?

836
00:58:20.747 --> 00:58:23.833
Because I seemed worthless,
the more she stood out.

837
00:58:33.134 --> 00:58:35.094
I always thought -
you are not good at anything

838
00:58:36.471 --> 00:58:37.889
but what are you good at?

839
00:58:38.973 --> 00:58:40.433
To blame others.

840
00:58:43.645 --> 00:58:47.065
Let's test how strong your devoted faith is.

841
00:58:48.066 --> 00:58:49.567
You should thank me.

842
00:58:50.610 --> 00:58:52.320
I avenged her for you.

843
00:58:54.030 --> 00:58:54.989
What?

844
00:58:55.073 --> 00:58:57.116
You think your parents died in an accident.

845
00:58:59.619 --> 00:59:00.828
But this is not true.

846
00:59:00.912 --> 00:59:02.747
They were killed by Choo Jung-suk,

847
00:59:03.414 --> 00:59:05.166
which you relied on the most.

848
00:59:06.042 --> 00:59:08.503
Your Almighty Chu,
whom you completely trusted

849
00:59:09.003 --> 00:59:11.714
killed your parents

850
00:59:27.438 --> 00:59:28.731
done

851
00:59:43.538 --> 00:59:44.872
That's much better.

852
00:59:45.707 --> 00:59:47.458
But the water pressure here is so low.

853
00:59:49.043 --> 00:59:50.295
I did not expect to meet you.

854
00:59:50.378 --> 00:59:51.254
What a coincidence.

855
00:59:53.631 --> 00:59:55.383
have you been following me

856
00:59:55.466 --> 00:59:56.593
In no case.

857
00:59:56.676 --> 00:59:58.428
I just had to go to the bathroom.

858
01:00:04.017 --> 01:00:05.184
And you are not surprised.

859
01:00:07.020 --> 01:00:07.895
OK.

860
01:00:07.979 --> 01:00:09.981
I have a question for you

861
01:00:10.064 --> 01:00:10.940
so that's great.

862
01:00:12.150 --> 01:00:13.067
But To Kyung

863
01:00:13.568 --> 01:00:15.403
took something important from me.

864
01:00:16.029 --> 01:00:17.989
A book in a green binding.

865
01:00:19.699 --> 01:00:20.658
Have you seen her?

866
01:00:24.162 --> 01:00:26.581
No, I'm afraid not.

867
01:00:31.919 --> 01:00:33.004
Did No Suk Min do it?

868
01:00:34.464 --> 01:00:35.465
I'm just

869
01:00:36.049 --> 01:00:38.009
I got burned while cooking.

870
01:00:38.509 --> 01:00:41.346
i really don't care
how it really happened.

871
01:00:41.429 --> 01:00:42.430
But...

872
01:00:44.057 --> 01:00:46.142
looks like your hell has just begun.

873
01:00:50.438 --> 01:00:52.023
Let me know if you find the book.

874
01:00:53.066 --> 01:00:54.067
Who knows?

875
01:00:54.734 --> 01:00:55.777
Maybe she...

876
01:00:57.445 --> 01:00:59.864
will open your way out of it.

877
01:01:07.038 --> 01:01:07.997
I will go

878
01:01:21.177 --> 01:01:22.512
delusional

879
01:01:23.721 --> 01:01:25.807
Do you really expect me to believe that?

880
01:01:36.984 --> 01:01:40.238
I was there the day your parents died.

881
01:01:42.782 --> 01:01:45.410
<i>A company at a crossroads.</i>

882
01:01:46.119 --> 01:01:49.080
<i>This is significant
investment offer - a rarity!</i>

883
01:01:49.956 --> 01:01:51.499
<i>You left me no choice.</i>

884
01:01:52.333 --> 01:01:55.086
I will expose everything.

885
01:02:03.177 --> 01:02:05.054
How dare you blackmail me?

886
01:02:05.930 --> 01:02:06.973
What do you want?

887
01:02:07.056 --> 01:02:08.182
Money?

888
01:02:09.142 --> 01:02:12.603
You left the company and ran away.

889
01:02:13.229 --> 01:02:14.897
What gives you that right?

890
01:02:15.857 --> 01:02:19.026
This company is mine.

891
01:02:19.110 --> 01:02:21.529
You did not build it yourself.

892
01:02:21.612 --> 01:02:23.906
It is built on blood, sweat and tears

893
01:02:23.990 --> 01:02:25.700
everyone who works here!

894
01:02:27.201 --> 01:02:28.661
- Dear
- Just wait.

895
01:02:28.745 --> 01:02:32.123
Everything will not go as you want.

896
01:02:43.468 --> 01:02:46.846
Mom left in a rage
behind your parents' car

897
01:02:46.929 --> 01:02:48.473
and you know what happened next.

898
01:02:49.474 --> 01:02:50.308
Boom!

899
01:02:52.602 --> 01:02:56.189
After that "Mire Electronics"
grew into "Mire Group".

900
01:02:58.191 --> 01:03:00.735
You can say, in its basis
the blood of your parents was shed.

901
01:03:04.113 --> 01:03:05.198
I don't believe that.

902
01:03:06.866 --> 01:03:09.660
My mother didn't believe in anything
not to mention religion.

903
01:03:09.744 --> 01:03:12.580
But she started almost every day
go to confession after their death!

904
01:03:12.663 --> 01:03:13.790
Why do you think?

905
01:03:13.873 --> 01:03:16.167
What was she so desperate to wash away?

906
01:03:16.250 --> 01:03:18.044
What exactly was she so afraid of?

907
01:03:19.670 --> 01:03:23.716
All signs of attention and love,
which she gave you

908
01:03:24.342 --> 01:03:27.261
were actually her ticket to heaven.

909
01:03:27.845 --> 01:03:28.679
No.

910
01:03:30.556 --> 01:03:31.474
This is a lie.

911
01:03:32.058 --> 01:03:33.142
You lie!

912
01:03:37.647 --> 01:03:39.106
Then ask her yourself.

913
01:03:39.774 --> 01:03:41.442
Is she in hell or heaven

914
01:03:41.526 --> 01:03:43.402
go and ask her yourself.

915
01:04:00.753 --> 01:04:01.754
He is to blame for everything!

916
01:04:03.881 --> 01:04:06.968
But Suk Min killed both Mom and To Kyung!

917
01:04:09.220 --> 01:04:11.472
And he was the one who tried to kill To To Hee.

918
01:04:19.188 --> 01:04:21.232
<i>No Suk Min, that scoundrel,</i>

919
01:04:22.191 --> 01:04:23.401
and is the devil.

920
01:04:50.386 --> 01:04:53.014
MY BELOVED DEMON

921
01:05:28.299 --> 01:05:30.968
{\an8}<i>There is one proof
which No Suk Min could not get rid of.</i>

922
01:05:31.052 --> 01:05:34.680
{\an8}How did you gather all this information
without his knowledge?

923
01:05:34.764 --> 01:05:37.600
{\an8}Is that true? Did my brother kill my mother?

924
01:05:39.226 --> 01:05:41.938
{\an8}Is it true that Choo Jung Suk killed To Hee's parents?

925
01:05:42.021 --> 01:05:45.066
{\an8}Just wait.
Everything will not go as you want.

926
01:05:45.149 --> 01:05:47.068
{\an8}<i>After what I went through,
to build a company...</i>

927
01:05:47.151 --> 01:05:48.736
{\an8}This must be made public.

928
01:05:48.819 --> 01:05:50.363
{\an8}How dare you destroy my company?

929
01:05:50.446 --> 01:05:52.239
{\an8}I will stop you even if it kills me.

930
01:05:53.240 --> 01:05:54.951
{\an8}I see you are desperate for something.

931
01:05:55.034 --> 01:05:57.119
{\an8}Do you want me to fulfill your wish?

932
01:06:01.040 --> 01:06:06.045
Translation of subtitles: Daria Hochel

